  ;;; ---- a term: one clause of text, then the engine's reader ----
  ;;;
  ;;; THE SCANNER KNOWS WHERE A CLAUSE ENDS AND NOTHING ELSE: a `.' that
  ;;; is not part of a symbol atom (`=..'), outside a quoted atom, a
  ;;; string, a back-quoted text, a `0'c' code and both kinds of comment,
